  "title": "Hungarian Pork Chops",
  "description": "Seasoned pork chops are quickly sauteed and then simmered in a rich and zesty blend of sherry, ketchup, Worcestershire sauce, paprika and bay leaf - with a good dose of sour cream to add a luscious tartness.",
